  "review_conclusions": [
    "Production calls use actual batch_size=1, one real candidate per forward; no dummy rows or relabelled batch4 execution.",
    "Full-sequence selected projection kernel, FP32 source model/runtime and dynamic right-padding remain the unchanged v2 implementation.",
